      "side": 1,
      "message": "HI Jameson Thies, The TBT devices are enumerated fine with this series.  fatcat:/ # echo 1 \u003e /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/ \n0-0/      0-0:1.1/  0-1/      1-0/      domain0/  domain1/ \nfatcat:/ # echo 1 \u003e /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0- \n0-0/      0-0:1.1/  0-1/ \nfatcat:/ # echo 1 \u003e /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/authorized \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/authorized \n1 \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/de \ndevice       device_name \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/device_name \nPro Thunderbolt 4 Dock \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/generation \n4 \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/tx \ntx_lanes  tx_speed \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/tx_speed \n20.0 Gb/s \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/rx \nrx_lanes  rx_speed \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/rx_ \nrx_lanes  rx_speed \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/rx_speed \n20.0 Gb/s \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/vendor \n0x13 \nfatcat:/ # cat /sys/bus/thunderbolt/devices/0-1/vendor_name \nBelkin International",
